WEBVTT

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
<b>Hamaminami Book Store</b>

00:13.250 --> 00:18.080
It's hot... I should probably call it
quits before I sweat more.

00:21.960 --> 00:23.380
Sajo-san!

00:28.630 --> 00:30.330
Sajo-san!

00:33.460 --> 00:35.670
Middle schooler...?

00:39.130 --> 00:41.830
Hello. It is hot again today, isn't it?

00:42.130 --> 00:43.080
That's true.

00:43.420 --> 00:45.460
My hair ends up all sticky and clingy...

00:46.790 --> 00:47.630
Whoa...!

00:49.250 --> 00:51.790
You know, we should watch out for heat exhaustion.

00:52.380 --> 00:54.290
It might be too late for that...

00:54.290 --> 00:54.960
What?

00:54.960 --> 00:56.080
Sajo-kun.

00:56.960 --> 00:57.790
<b>Ichinose</b>

01:19.000 --> 01:22.960
<b>The Dreaming Boy</b>

01:19.000 --> 01:22.960
<b>is a Realist</b>

01:23.080 --> 01:28.670
Nozoki dasu sora no gourei de omoi kakaeta mama shuppatsu

01:28.670 --> 01:33.380
Me wa au noni kaze de yurete toomawari

01:34.460 --> 01:39.920
Akogare matataki no shutter omoide wa kokoro kazatta

01:39.920 --> 01:45.380
Kono jikan, suki mitai modokashii noni

01:46.420 --> 01:51.290
Hanarete chikazuite akirame kaketa yume

01:51.540 --> 01:56.960
Umaku oritateru hi oikakete mitaina

01:56.960 --> 02:02.380
Joukuu ippai ni natta tsutae kirenai koto

02:02.540 --> 02:08.170
Nazeka iro chigai no kimi no honne surechigatta

02:08.170 --> 02:16.460
Mayotchai sou dakedo sora wa zutto futatsu no kodou

02:16.460 --> 02:18.960
Nando mo tsutaeta

02:19.130 --> 02:25.130
Ao no kanjou kuttsuke tara donna keshiki hirogaru no kana

02:25.130 --> 02:29.830
Irodotta omoi shiritainda

02:36.790 --> 02:39.710
<b>Your Leg's Already at T-minus 5 Seconds Before Blastoff!</b>

02:40.170 --> 02:42.540
A female middle schooler, who's college student-like...

02:43.040 --> 02:45.420
A female high schooler, who's middle schooler-like...

02:46.130 --> 02:47.540
I'm getting confused.

02:50.960 --> 02:56.750
For the Phantom Thief Fluorite series, for sure it
is "The Captive Princess of the Clock Tower" right?

02:52.000 --> 02:56.750
<b>Phantom Thief Fluorite</b>

02:52.000 --> 02:56.750
<b>The Captive Princess of the Clock Tower</b>

02:57.210 --> 02:58.500
That brings back memories.

02:58.710 --> 03:02.670
If it was around the same time, then there was like "The
Moving Armor of the Underground Palace" and such.

03:02.670 --> 03:04.920
The description of the last chapter was complex.

03:05.170 --> 03:11.460
Oh! I brought this. Mina-san, it is the "Welcome to
the Honeybee Hotel" that you said you were looking for.

03:11.670 --> 03:14.380
Th-this is... The out-of-print one.

03:11.750 --> 03:14.380
<b>Welcome to the Honeybee Hotel</b>

03:14.630 --> 03:15.830
You sure?

03:15.830 --> 03:19.040
Of course! Please let me know what you think of it.

03:19.170 --> 03:20.170
Wow!

03:21.330 --> 03:24.250
So, this is what happens
when avid readers get together...

03:24.790 --> 03:27.420
Surprisingly, Ichinose-san actually looks older...

