<b>Looks good.</b>

03:30.590 --> 03:36.380
<b>Nonoka</b>

03:30.590 --> 03:36.380
<b>Amazing.</b>

03:30.590 --> 03:36.380
<b>Iwata</b>

03:30.590 --> 03:36.380
<b>It's all on you.</b>

03:30.590 --> 03:36.380
<b>Takaaki Sasaki</b>

03:30.590 --> 03:36.380
<b>beginning for the kouhai.</b>

03:32.170 --> 03:33.080
Huh.

03:33.080 --> 03:36.380
So, that's the orientation meeting for the school visit tour.

03:37.250 --> 03:39.210
You know, he sucks at taking photos.

03:40.170 --> 03:41.380
And, saved.

