<b>Iwata</b>

03:46.630 --> 03:47.380
<b>It's all on you.</b>

03:46.920 --> 03:47.380
<b>Takaaki Sasaki</b>

03:46.920 --> 03:47.380
<b>Starting from now, preparations</b>

03:46.920 --> 03:47.380
<b>beginning for the kouhai.</b>

03:46.920 --> 03:47.380
<b>Zakiyama</b>

03:46.920 --> 03:47.380
<b>You got this!</b>

03:48.000 --> 03:48.790
Huh!?

03:49.420 --> 03:51.420
<b>Today</b>

03:49.420 --> 03:51.420
<b>You have time today?</b>

03:53.460 --> 03:54.710
The usual.

03:56.290 --> 03:58.330
As if I can tell. What do you want?

03:58.330 --> 03:59.960
That. A cold one.

03:59.960 --> 04:00.830
Huh?

04:01.170 --> 04:01.880
Oh...

04:02.880 --> 04:03.750
Gimme.

04:04.040 --> 04:05.080
Yeah, yeah...

04:06.080 --> 04:06.750
Here.

04:08.580 --> 04:10.540
I'm surprised you've continued with it.

04:10.540 --> 04:11.210
Huh?

04:11.210 --> 04:15.420
The part-time job. Plus, I hear you're apparently
even looking after Ichinose's younger sister.

04:17.130 --> 04:17.830
What!?

04:18.170 --> 04:18.960
How...!?

04:19.170 --> 04:20.880
Where...? Who...?

04:21.500 --> 04:24.790
Don't underestimate the intel network of the
Vice President of the Student Council, you know?

04:25.130 --> 04:26.960
Why would the Student Council...?

04:28.000 --> 04:30.750
Hang on, did you hear that from Shinomiya-senpai?

04:31.750 --> 04:33.380
Speaking of, Big Sis.

04:33.380 --> 04:36.830
What about you? Even though you're the Vice President,
I'm surprised you're working until late.

04:37.130 --> 04:40.540
Although you say you're tired and bored,
you've got that corporate slave mentality, you know?

04:40.540 --> 04:41.000
Hmpf!

04:41.000 --> 04:41.670
Whoa!

04:41.670 --> 04:45.130
What? Is there some reason why I can't work seriously?

04:45.750 --> 04:48.750
Your leg! Your leg's already at
T-minus 5 seconds before blastoff!

04:48.750 --> 04:53.710
You know, the thing is, if you have that much spare time,
then could you help out with the school visit tour?

04:54.040 --> 04:57.250
Huh? You know two people from
each class were sent to help out.

04:57.710 --> 05:00.920
The personnel sent from the classes
will be the guides for the middle schoolers.

05:01.210 --> 05:05.880
You see, there are a lot of tour applicants this year.
There's a labor shortage on Rin's side.

05:06.170 --> 05:10.880
The thing is, even as the Student Council is helping out,
the work is over capacity, and it's getting carried over.

05:11.250 --> 05:13.080
That's an unpleasant carryover.

05:16.210 --> 05:18.250
But why does that mean I have to?

05:18.250 --> 05:21.540
If it's after dusk then your part-time job is over
and you have free time, right?

05:22.080 --> 05:25.000
I don't want to owe anything to Rin. I'm counting on you.

05:25.330 --> 05:28.380
"Owe anything"...? As if you have that
kind of commendable quality-

05:28.380 --> 05:28.830
Hmpf!

05:28.830 --> 05:29.630
Whoa!

05:30.380 --> 05:35.420
Plus, Rin is complaining to me about how she got
rejected by you, so hurry up and do something about it.

05:35.750 --> 05:36.380
Huh?

05:37.250 --> 05:41.330
There is absolutely no way I would be fit to be
a Morals & Discipline Committee member,

05:42.380 --> 05:45.790
so I will have to firmly refuse.

05:46.960 --> 05:50.290
Oh no! All I did was decline the invitation to become
a Morals & Discipline Committee member, okay!?

05:50.290 --> 05:53.960
What I'm saying is, don't let some weird
feeling of discontent continue to be there.

05:53.960 --> 05:55.580
S-seriously...?

05:56.380 --> 06:00.670
What am I supposed to do when an acquaintance is
concerned about her relationship to my younger brother?

06:01.170 --> 06:05.500
By any chance, have I unknowingly
ended up owing Big Sis a favor?  

06:07.630 --> 06:11.130
It's probably annoying to have to hear that kind
of talk at a time when she's super busy.

06:11.830 --> 06:13.040
I got it.

06:13.290 --> 06:16.920
I should just help out, right? I'll charge in with a battle cry.

06:21.830 --> 06:24.750
If it's her, then she might be
more pleased that way, you know?

06:25.040 --> 06:28.040
Plus, there's no doubt she probably
doesn't want you to dislike her.

06:28.040 --> 06:31.670
Stop that. When you say things like that,
it makes it harder for me to do it.

06:28.040 --> 06:33.290
<b>Milk</b>

06:32.040 --> 06:33.290
For Rin...

06:33.290 --> 06:37.130
Most likely, her relationship to you isn't one
where I'm sandwiched in-between.

06:44.000 --> 06:44.830
Here you go.

06:45.460 --> 06:46.580
In that case, here.

06:46.580 --> 06:47.170
Huh?

06:55.920 --> 06:56.790
Hello?

06:56.790 --> 06:59.420
U-um, is this Shinomiya-senpai?

06:59.750 --> 07:02.500
Huh? Um, who is this? Where's Kaede?

07:02.790 --> 07:05.250
If it's Big Sis, then she's next to me sleeping.

07:05.250 --> 07:07.080
Don't act all boyfriend-like!

07:07.080 --> 07:09.630
M-m-m-my ear! It's gonna tear off! It's gonna tear off!

07:09.630 --> 07:12.380
What? Uh, Sajo? Why are you...!?

07:12.830 --> 07:15.420
It has been a while, Shinomiya-senpai.

07:15.670 --> 07:19.000
There was something I wanted to talk to you about
a little, so I borrowed Big Sis' smartphone and-

07:19.000 --> 07:20.040
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

07:20.040 --> 07:22.210
Oh, okay... Is that so?  

07:22.460 --> 07:27.210
Kaede, let him go, please.
Sajo, you had business with me, right?

07:28.420 --> 07:32.040
Just this side has definitely gotten stretched.
It's turned into a big earlobe.

07:33.460 --> 07:38.460
The school visit tour is coming up soon, right?
So, I thought I could possibly help out.

07:38.920 --> 07:43.710
Oh, that's it? You don't have to be concerned.
We'll somehow do something on our end.

07:44.040 --> 07:47.580
What the...? Did I just get politely refused?

07:50.540 --> 07:52.080
Oh no, please don't say that.

07:52.080 --> 07:55.540
Shinomiya-senpai, there is the fact that I want
to see you on a personal level as well.

07:55.540 --> 07:57.000
What!? "Personal"...!?

07:57.580 --> 07:59.830
What in the world are you blurting out so suddenly!?

08:00.130 --> 08:05.210
Well, you know, it's just a young man talking nonsense.
But, if there really is something I can help out with, then...

08:05.420 --> 08:12.210
L-let's see... To tell the truth, I would appreciate that.
But it's manual labor, you know? Are you okay with that?

08:12.750 --> 08:15.170
If it's for your sake, Shinomiya-senpai,
then it'll be a piece of cake.

08:15.170 --> 08:16.540
What the!?

08:17.830 --> 08:18.460
Hmpf!

08:18.460 --> 08:19.250
Whoa!  

08:19.830 --> 08:24.330
<b>During the summer break,</b>

08:19.830 --> 08:24.330
<b>this gate will be closed.</b>

08:19.830 --> 08:24.330
<b>Visitors are requested to go</b>

08:19.840 --> 08:24.330
<b>to the reception desk side.</b>

08:19.840 --> 08:24.330
<b>The Student Council</b>

08:21.750 --> 08:24.170
So... It has been a long time.  

08:24.670 --> 08:27.170
No, not even one month has passed, you know?

08:27.670 --> 08:29.420
W-well, that's true too.

08:30.250 --> 08:32.130
Why are you being all awkward?

08:32.630 --> 08:35.920
Just like before, please confidently
show affection to your kouhai.

08:36.080 --> 08:40.290
Huh!? Can I take that to mean you will join
the Morals & Discipline Committee?  

08:40.500 --> 08:42.380
That and this are different issues.

08:42.630 --> 08:44.290
Uh... Oh...

08:44.830 --> 08:46.420
Is it that much of a shock?

08:47.290 --> 08:49.920
Regarding the incident at the school cafeteria,

08:49.920 --> 08:53.540
where you threw off Yuyu's hands, and then
you grasped them again, but ultimately ran away...  

08:54.250 --> 08:54.830
Oh!

08:55.330 --> 08:55.710
Oh!

08:55.710 --> 08:57.170
<b>Morals &</b>

08:55.710 --> 08:57.170
<b>Discipline</b>

08:55.880 --> 08:56.580
Huh!?

08:56.670 --> 08:57.170
Huh!?

08:57.540 --> 09:02.920
I was thinking that by disregarding your feelings,
I may have conversely angered Yuyu.

09:04.380 --> 09:08.960
Inatomi-senpai? Well, you'll have
to get back in her favor then.

09:10.250 --> 09:13.710
After all, this person is very fond of Inatomi-senpai.

09:14.170 --> 09:20.000
Well, if it's just that it gets awkward between us,
then you really weren't that worried, right?  

09:20.960 --> 09:24.670
Th-that's not the case! In fact, I wish
I could have you as a younger brother!

09:24.670 --> 09:25.630
No way. Why?

09:26.500 --> 09:28.960
Well, I guess I would be the manual labor too, right?

09:28.960 --> 09:32.830
There's no way you would make
the cute Inatomi-senpai sweat after all, right?

09:33.250 --> 09:38.330
H-hey, I meant what I said, you know? Am I the only one
who thinks that was a barbed comment?

09:38.540 --> 09:39.960
It's just your imagination.

09:39.960 --> 09:41.330
Y-you sure...?

09:43.790 --> 09:47.580
Maybe it's because she's too straightforward,
but it's hard for her to get my jokes.

09:47.960 --> 09:51.750
For the moment, since standing here and
talking is one thing, shall we get going?

09:54.580 --> 09:57.380
What the Student Council and
class representatives will be in charge of,

09:57.380 --> 10:00.790
is mainly to interact with the middle schoolers
and show them the school.

10:01.170 --> 10:04.880
On the other hand, the Morals & Discipline Committee
is in charge of transporting equipment,

10:04.880 --> 10:07.290
and preparing to set-up the meeting place.

10:07.630 --> 10:11.630
<b>Morals &</b>

10:07.630 --> 10:11.630
<b>Discipline</b>

10:07.960 --> 10:10.750
In other words, they are the unsung heroes
doing the thankless tasks.

10:10.750 --> 10:11.630
Exactly.

10:12.210 --> 10:16.420
However, the Morals & Discipline Committee members
are overwhelmingly made up mostly of girls.

10:16.920 --> 10:17.750
Ah...

10:18.630 --> 10:21.380
It's not as if we couldn't handle it by the numbers,
but it would be appreciated,

10:21.380 --> 10:25.290
if we could reduce the risk of a situation where
we only have girls doing the transporting.

10:25.880 --> 10:28.540
Can I really be of help when it's just me as one person?

10:29.790 --> 10:34.670
Although this goes without saying, there is also
a part of this, where I am asking, because it's you.

10:34.670 --> 10:35.330
Huh...?

10:37.040 --> 10:37.920
At first glance...

10:38.250 --> 10:40.580
No matter how much a job seems simple,

10:40.580 --> 10:43.250
it follows that there is sponsor responsibility
and confidentiality obligations.

10:43.750 --> 10:47.250
You are here, because I have the conviction
that it will be fine if it's you.

10:47.630 --> 10:52.790
Well, if I get to show off my manliness to the girls, then I'll
never have a blessed opportunity this good, you know?

10:53.630 --> 10:54.420
Why, you...!

10:54.420 --> 10:54.960
Whoa!

10:54.960 --> 10:56.500
Hey... You're heavy!

10:56.500 --> 10:57.670
How rude!

10:58.710 --> 11:05.710
As you go about showing around the visitors, please be
responsible as representatives of Koetsu High School
and act accordingly.

11:06.170 --> 11:07.040
"Representatives"...?  

11:07.670 --> 11:09.210
This is a tacit understanding but...

11:09.210 --> 11:15.540
<b>Orientation meeting for the school visit tour</b>

11:09.210 --> 11:15.540
<b>Please take a printout</b>

11:09.210 --> 11:15.540
<b>and have a seat.</b>

11:09.210 --> 11:15.540
<b>Student</b>

11:09.210 --> 11:15.540
<b>Council</b>

11:09.920 --> 11:11.880
You know, there is a sense that students

11:11.880 --> 11:15.330
of a certain level of attractive faces and figures,
and academic excellence were desired.

11:15.880 --> 11:19.330
My homeroom teacher gave priority to
those of us who go straight home, though.

11:19.330 --> 11:21.830
Well, there may have been classes like that too.

11:22.880 --> 11:24.080
I see.

11:24.330 --> 11:28.750
By using sociable members, they're trying to get
the middle schoolers to harbor admiration, huh?

11:28.920 --> 11:30.210
That makes sense.

11:32.080 --> 11:37.790
Oh yeah... Well, of course she'd be there. She's with
Sasaki, huh...? They look good together, but...

11:38.460 --> 11:39.290
Whoa!

11:39.290 --> 11:40.830
Bad timing!

11:42.330 --> 11:44.170
H-hey! What's wrong?

11:44.710 --> 11:46.170
Oh, no. It's nothing.

11:47.830 --> 11:49.500
What's up, Sasaki-kun?

11:49.500 --> 11:50.290
Just now...

11:51.040 --> 11:52.420
No, it's nothing.

11:53.540 --> 11:55.540
<b>Student Guidance Room</b>

11:54.710 --> 11:55.880
Long time no see!

11:55.880 --> 11:56.830
Sajo-kun!

11:58.630 --> 12:01.210
So, Sajo-kun, I see that you're the outside help.

12:01.630 --> 12:02.790
Looking forward to working with you!   

12:02.920 --> 12:05.000
Oh, yes. Looking forward to it too.

12:08.000 --> 12:12.580
Yeah, lately, all Mina does is talk about you, Sajo-kun.

12:12.580 --> 12:13.290
Right?

12:13.290 --> 12:13.960
Yeah.

12:14.170 --> 12:16.040
Oh. I-is that so?

12:16.500 --> 12:22.000
That reserved Mina laughs a lot now.
The part-time job must really be fulfilling, you know?

12:22.290 --> 12:24.130
Y-you think so...?

12:25.000 --> 12:26.830
Thanks, Sajo-kun.

12:27.170 --> 12:27.920
Okay...

12:29.250 --> 12:34.380
There's that part of him as an older brother,
but fundamentally, he's a good person, probably.

12:30.920 --> 12:31.670
Right?

12:32.080 --> 12:32.830
Yeah.

12:34.210 --> 12:35.290
I'm really glad.

12:35.290 --> 12:39.670
Since Ichinose-san isn't here today, there probably
won't be any reckless behavior like that time.

12:40.580 --> 12:41.710
So, um...

12:42.710 --> 12:44.710
What is it that I should do?

12:45.330 --> 12:48.790
Yeah, let's see... First off is...

12:51.000 --> 12:55.000
<b>The Dreaming Boy</b>

12:51.000 --> 12:55.000
<b>is a Realist</b>

12:56.960 --> 12:58.250
Is that all for the questions?

12:58.750 --> 13:02.210
Well then, today will be the last
of the orientation meetings.

13:02.580 --> 13:05.170
We will appreciate everyone's support on the day of.

13:06.750 --> 13:08.750
<b>Orientation meeting for the school visit tour</b>

13:06.750 --> 13:08.750
<b>Please take a printout</b>

13:06.750 --> 13:08.750
<b>and have a seat.</b>

13:09.460 --> 13:10.750
Hey, Natsukawa.

13:10.750 --> 13:12.130
Huh? What's up?  

13:12.380 --> 13:13.750
So, this week...

13:14.710 --> 13:19.000
There's a practice match for the soccer club,
so if you want to, wanna come see it?

13:21.630 --> 13:24.580
I have to take care of my younger sister, so I'm kind of...

13:24.580 --> 13:25.210
Oh...

13:25.830 --> 13:27.330
I-I see...

13:30.920 --> 13:31.960
I'm sorry.

13:33.170 --> 13:35.080
It was nice of you to invite me, though.

13:35.080 --> 13:36.380
Oh, no. Not at all...

13:36.750 --> 13:38.290
But thanks.

13:38.670 --> 13:43.040
Absolutely. How's Airi-chan? I'd like to see her again.

13:43.290 --> 13:44.330
Um...

13:45.330 --> 13:46.040
Yeah...

13:50.330 --> 13:51.500
Natsukawa-san!

13:52.000 --> 13:55.080
Aren't you going to the karaoke?
Everyone's saying they're all going.

13:55.670 --> 13:58.080
Sorry. I have some family stuff, so...

13:58.670 --> 14:00.380
I see. Too bad!  

14:00.750 --> 14:01.710
Sorry.  

14:02.080 --> 14:03.130
No problem.

14:03.130 --> 14:05.670
We were thinking that would
probably be the case anyway.

14:05.960 --> 14:06.630
What?

14:06.630 --> 14:07.580
See ya.

14:11.750 --> 14:15.250
The me at that time didn't even have
the slightest leeway for anything.

14:15.710 --> 14:18.500
Whether it was time, and also emotionally...

14:19.750 --> 14:22.380
The difference in circumstances
between me and my classmates,

14:22.380 --> 14:24.630
who were spending the days having fun as usual.

14:25.460 --> 14:27.420
The self-control, in order to
never compare that difference,

14:27.420 --> 14:30.460
because I shouldn't ever get
depressed or irritated by that.

14:31.170 --> 14:36.960
But the complicated feelings gradually became bigger,
and I was almost getting crushed by them.

14:36.960 --> 14:38.580
Okay. I'm coming right now!

14:43.210 --> 14:45.330
If that was me, I wouldn't be able
to come to school anymore.

14:46.210 --> 14:49.420
And of all things, that's a mapo tofu bowl.

14:49.830 --> 14:52.380
Sorry. Is that beneath me to say so?

14:53.040 --> 14:54.130
Natsukawa-san?

14:55.040 --> 14:56.080
You okay?

14:56.500 --> 14:58.130
Oh, yes.

14:59.000 --> 15:03.380
I didn't approach and talk to him out
of kindness or because I was being nice.

15:04.170 --> 15:10.080
No one was helping him, and he was there dazed and
shocked, and I ended up seeing myself in him.

15:10.830 --> 15:12.080
That's all that was.

15:17.290 --> 15:18.130
Um!

15:18.290 --> 15:21.460
Thank you very much for helping me yesterday!

15:21.710 --> 15:23.080
Oh... Sure.

15:23.630 --> 15:29.080
My name is Wataru Sajo. Aika Natsukawa-san,
I fell in love at first sight with your kindness!

15:29.540 --> 15:31.630
Would you please go out with me!?

15:39.670 --> 15:42.790
I'm sorry. Right now, that kind of thing is...

15:43.830 --> 15:45.000
I see...

15:46.500 --> 15:48.790
Um, is there like a reason?

15:49.540 --> 15:55.290
I'm busy, so things like going out with
someone is something I can't think about, so...

15:55.290 --> 15:57.790
You're busy? Like with club activities?

15:58.830 --> 16:01.210
I have no intention of telling you
about my circumstances.

16:09.170 --> 16:10.540
Oh! Natsukawa-san!

16:10.960 --> 16:11.630
Huh?

16:12.380 --> 16:13.290
Morning!

16:13.290 --> 16:14.040
What...?

16:14.630 --> 16:17.290
It's at least okay for me to head to school with you, right?

16:17.830 --> 16:19.080
Ever since then...

16:19.710 --> 16:22.210
He'd repeatedly show up to see me.

16:23.460 --> 16:26.540
Natsukawa-san. Could you just
explain this problem to me?

16:26.830 --> 16:31.080
Hey, is it okay if I call you by your first name?
Please let me call you that way, I'm begging you.

16:31.330 --> 16:34.330
Aika, I'll hold your stuff, so let's go together.

16:34.880 --> 16:39.080
He was always in good spirits, brazen, and positive.

16:39.830 --> 16:41.080
Why me?

16:41.290 --> 16:42.580
No, thank you.

16:42.830 --> 16:43.790
I don't want to.

16:44.460 --> 16:48.880
No matter how hard I came down on him,
it appeared that his feelings wouldn't change.

16:49.500 --> 16:52.250
Yeah, for sure, Aika, you're the best!

16:53.080 --> 16:56.500
Natsukawa-san, I hear that
some weird boy is stalking you?

16:57.080 --> 16:58.880
Well, Natsukawa-san is cute.

16:58.880 --> 17:00.330
Nothing can be done about that.

17:00.330 --> 17:02.580
If it comes down to it, we'll protect you, okay?

17:01.170 --> 17:05.580
Before I knew it, those around me
were talking to me a lot.

17:06.290 --> 17:09.580
When I think about it now, by talking to him or to others,

17:09.580 --> 17:13.830
the burden on my shoulders was lightened
from almost being crushed; I think.

17:15.040 --> 17:17.040
After that, the entrance exams were coming up, so then...

17:17.880 --> 17:21.250
There was a time when he didn't come
around to see me for a while.

17:33.880 --> 17:36.630
<b>Successful Applicants - Exam ID Numbers</b>

17:34.170 --> 17:36.420
No way! It's really there!

17:39.080 --> 17:41.500
Oh, Mom!? It says I got accepted!

17:42.460 --> 17:48.630
Yeah, uh-huh. That's right. I'm glad.
Thanks. Yeah. I'm relieved...

17:49.040 --> 17:49.880
Oh!

17:50.170 --> 17:53.170
<b>Successful Applicants - Exam ID Numbers</b>

17:51.040 --> 17:54.080
Isn't that it!? Isn't that it!? There! It's there! It's there!

17:56.080 --> 18:01.080
Aika, congratulations on getting in!
Will you say congratulations to me too?

18:02.420 --> 18:04.920
So, you were aiming for Koetsu High School.

18:05.210 --> 18:09.170
I wanted to attend the same high school as you, Aika.
You know, I did study after all.

18:12.330 --> 18:15.000
Hey, stop that! It's not like we're at middle school!

18:15.460 --> 18:16.290
Is that a no?

18:16.670 --> 18:17.920
Well, of course!

18:18.420 --> 18:22.920
Well then, call me by my first name.
Not "You" or "Sajo" or stuff like that.

18:22.920 --> 18:23.540
Huh!?

18:23.540 --> 18:25.330
But I don't understand why.  

18:25.330 --> 18:26.330
Please!

18:28.460 --> 18:30.630
Fine, I got it! Will you stop that!

18:31.710 --> 18:33.130
Alright!

18:33.880 --> 18:35.710
Natsukawa-san, you're popular with the boys, you know?

18:36.040 --> 18:39.790
You mean "you-know-who," right?
He's just stalking me as he pleases, that's all.

18:39.790 --> 18:42.130
Sajotchi? He's funny, you know?

18:42.500 --> 18:44.080
Hang on, "Sajotchi"...?

18:46.540 --> 18:48.080
Like the other day too.

18:47.210 --> 18:50.580
Even after high school started,
his behavior was unchanged...

18:48.080 --> 18:49.880
There he was, coming into the classroom.

18:50.290 --> 18:53.500
And the back of his hair was like, "Whoa!"

18:51.460 --> 18:55.670
But various people like Kei appeared around me and...

18:56.790 --> 19:00.330
Although it wasn't quite the high
school life that I had envisioned,

19:00.330 --> 19:03.630
I ended up being able to lead
relatively fulfilling days, every day.

19:06.420 --> 19:08.670
That's what I had thought...

19:10.040 --> 19:14.000
Aika, Aika! What's this? By any chance,
were you like waiting for me?

19:14.630 --> 19:15.380
There's no...!

19:20.040 --> 19:21.500
Oh! Huh? Hey!

19:34.420 --> 19:35.460
Is something wrong?

19:35.460 --> 19:36.290
No.

19:36.960 --> 19:38.250
What're you up to now?  

19:38.790 --> 19:40.830
Oh... Going home, I guess...

19:41.420 --> 19:43.420
I see. Of course.

19:46.380 --> 19:49.420
Hey... Are you thinking about Sajo?

19:49.420 --> 19:50.210
What!?

19:50.210 --> 19:51.750
Wh-why!?

19:52.130 --> 19:54.130
Well, how do I put this...?  

19:56.170 --> 19:57.040
So...

19:57.750 --> 19:58.580
Oh...

19:58.580 --> 19:59.960
Sorry, it's my little sister.

20:00.540 --> 20:01.330
What's up?

20:13.920 --> 20:16.920
<b>Sajo, Aika, K</b>

20:13.920 --> 20:16.920
<b>Sajo</b>

20:13.920 --> 20:16.920
<b>About the part-time job matter;</b>

20:13.920 --> 20:16.920
<b>looks like somehow, it's going to work out.</b>

20:13.920 --> 20:16.920
<b>Thanks for the advice.</b>

20:13.920 --> 20:16.920
<b>Hang in there!</b>

20:15.460 --> 20:16.540
Wataru...

20:17.210 --> 20:19.290
Well, I did harass you mercilessly up until now.

20:20.330 --> 20:23.710
I wanted to say I'm not going
to follow you around anymore.

20:25.000 --> 20:26.130
Hey Natsukawa!

20:28.040 --> 20:29.330
I miss you...

20:31.080 --> 20:32.540
What am I saying!?

20:33.040 --> 20:35.750
What's up with that!? I don't get it! He just arbitrarily...

20:37.420 --> 20:38.290
So stupid...

20:48.290 --> 20:49.080
Oh!

21:00.710 --> 21:01.630
There he is!

21:17.500 --> 21:18.790
Aika! Morning!

21:19.460 --> 21:21.920
I got it! Aika, it's just like you said!

21:22.540 --> 21:25.750
Aika, you're amazing. On top of that, you're cute.

21:28.420 --> 21:30.500
What's up with that? Honestly...

21:56.670 --> 21:58.380
Ouch. Ow...

21:59.040 --> 22:00.630
N... Natsukawa?

22:00.630 --> 22:02.250
Oh! Wataru...

22:02.630 --> 22:04.540
Ow, ow, ow...

22:05.960 --> 22:07.920
Why are you in such a hurry?

22:28.500 --> 22:30.960
Mou, shitsukoi! Danante, ne

22:31.250 --> 22:34.540
Aa. Iwanakya yokatta na...

22:35.380 --> 22:41.500
Demo ne nande sona kyuu ni sokkenai kao shite kuruno...

22:43.210 --> 22:45.420
Kidoku no mama oitekebori na message

22:45.420 --> 22:47.710
Demo group dato henshin aru mitai na

22:47.920 --> 22:49.880
Chikai to omottara tooku natte

22:50.130 --> 22:51.670
Nande konna sabishin daro

22:51.670 --> 22:53.540
Kyou wa oikakete... kurenai no?

22:53.540 --> 22:55.080
Sunao ni naretara ii noni

22:56.540 --> 23:02.880
Datte hajimete shitta no konna setsunai kimochi ga aru kototte...

23:02.880 --> 23:04.290
Nanoni, nee!

23:04.290 --> 23:05.830
Doushite itchau no??

23:05.830 --> 23:07.580
Nande naisho nano!?

23:07.790 --> 23:09.960
Modokashii darake de...

23:09.960 --> 23:11.330
Aa! Aa!

23:11.330 --> 23:13.040
Ienai yo konna no

23:13.040 --> 23:17.040
Dakedo sakki wa honne janai kara

23:17.040 --> 23:18.420
Tsutawatte yo

23:18.500 --> 23:20.130
Doushite okotchau no...

23:20.130 --> 23:21.670
Kawaiku dekinai no...

23:21.670 --> 23:24.130
Kirai ni natta no...??

23:24.290 --> 23:27.000
Aa! Aa! A, aa!

23:29.000 --> 23:29.960
Doushite

23:30.630 --> 23:31.920
Kirai ni naranai de

23:34.960 --> 23:36.330
...Kiite, "Anone...!"
